#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0746 expect=noViolation domain=ADAE
# Rule:Description: SRCDOM has a value that is not an SDTM domain name, ADaM dataset name, or null
#note "SRCDOM = LB names the SDTM domain LB, which is submitted only as splits (LBCH, LBHE; DOMAIN LB) with no dataset named LB. The domain is present, so no violation. Until 2026-10-02 the rule compared SRCDOM with dataset_names() only and fired here."
# Declared-tier scope: structure= states the ADaM data structure this minimal table stands for;
# #define is its mandatory carrier (ScenarioDeclaredScopeProvider.install).
#define standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADAE structure=BDS
col SRCDOM type=Char
---
LB
---

dataset LBCH
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
---
STUDY01 | LB
---

dataset LBHE
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
---
STUDY01 | LB
---

dataset ADSL
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
---
STUDY01
---
